onal function that performs three-dimensional image processing.\n\nIt is to be installed and used on general-purpose IT equipment, etc. that meets the specifications specified by Holoeyes Corporation (hereinafter referred to as \"the Company\") in the manner specified by the Company and provided as a download. For details, please refer to the attached document.\n\nThe latest version of the attached document (electronic attachment) https://holoeyes.jp/pmda/", "short_description": "The medical imaging software \"Holoeyes MD\" is a controlled medical device (generic name: program for general-purpose diagnostic imaging workstations, certification number: 302ADBZX00011000) under the \"Act on Quality, Efficacy and Safety Assurance of Pharmaceuticals, Medical Devices, etc.\" (Pharmaceuticals and Medical Devices Act)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "md_logo.png", "id": "5998065973633964", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003260_5998065976967297_260827317627691552_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qiu6ySz7p5UQ7kNvwFS4OBL&_nc_oc=AdqBi9kEajO1IZe0oQCc9vbE8IMaiiXcxBNQx2pUmBfwzn8_qufYmZ3JUPfV5RDIjbo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzvYvPEGmP6y2kBz7hVQc7xujYuRjvXIE4POzrb77mbwA&oe=69CBBD4D"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_tate.png", "id": "2303415159832893", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974904_2303415163166226_7688600240374808365_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pqOHskZODhAQ7kNvwGhVAXb&_nc_oc=AdqcPeqNkBNHwGyqks8Tu2g01OH57pO0OgbTmp2bbZuGavrAbmcs6bPyVxdpg_ULlRo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyB_QensZk9hkh-6EdIzmdB95TlEhfIp2nLbInDKvafYA&oe=69CBAFAC"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_miniyoko.png", "id": "950325029433473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031585_950325032766806_6345